  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9e93f5892874ed343993c8f9511f87a5, type: 3}
  m_Name: LevelOneDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Dialogue
  levelName: LevelOne
  lines:
  - Oh no! I've fallen out of my cage! I need to find a mouse hole somewhere in this
    room if I want to get back!
  - The cat seems to be sound asleep, hopefully it doesn't wake up...
  - I wonder what this ball could be used for...maybe the cat will find it interesting.
  - Under this bed seems like a safe space. Hopefully I won't need to use it...
  - That box seems to have a hole in it. Could be worth investigating...
